# IONIQ 5 research repository policy.
#
# Raw captures, firmware and personal data stay outside this public Git history.
# Store only sanitized research findings and tests here.

# --- Exact official package download exclusion ----------------------------
/NaU/
2021_22_IONIQ_5_AU/
**/2021_22_IONIQ_5_AU/

# --- Live credentials and private-key material ----------------------------
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.mobileprovision
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
/secrets/
/credentials/

# --- Regenerable local tooling noise --------------------------------------
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
